    {
      "@id": "concept:act-sch-3-sec-28-2-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "0.5000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Temporal interval for obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "BETWEEN",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) The court, tribunal or commission: (a) must, unless it considers that it is not in the interests of justice to do so, hold in private that part of the proceedings that relates to the matter referred to in paragraph (1)(a), (b) or (c); and"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:act-sch-3-sec-28-2-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to hold proceedings in private",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) The court, tribunal or commission:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:act-sch-3-sec-28-2-ss-2-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to make orders to suppress publication of evidence",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) must make such orders relating to the suppression of publication of evidence given before it as, in its opinion, will ensure that the matter referred to in paragraph (1)(a), (b) or (c) is not made public;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:act-sch-3-sec-28-2-ss-2-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to ensure confidentiality",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) The court, tribunal or commission: (a) must, unless it considers that it is not in the interests of justice to do so, hold in private that part of the proceedings that relates to the matter referred to in paragraph (1)(a), (b) or (c); and"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:act-sch-3-sec-28-2-ss-2-logic-linearlogic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::linear",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Two obligations combined",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LinearLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "AND",
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) The court, tribunal or commission: (a) must, unless it considers that it is not in the interests of justice to do so, hold in private that part of the proceedings that relates to the matter referred to in paragraph (1)(a), (b) or (c); and (b) must make such orders relating to the suppression of publication of evidence given before it as, in its opinion, will ensure that the matter referred to in paragraph (1)(a), (b) or (c) is not made public;"
    },
